msgstr "%ls ms CPU + %ls ms GPU"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%ls ms CPU"
msgstr "%ls ms CPU"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%ls ms GPU"
msgstr "%ls ms GPU"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now: the mod's DLAA / DLSS work costs nothing."
msgstr "Сега изкл.: работата на DLAA / DLSS на мода не струва нищо."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The whole mod costs %ls per frame now; off saves most of it."
msgstr "Целият мод струва %ls на кадър сега; изкл. спестява повечето."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs nothing itself; watch the perf lines for what it saves."
msgstr "Сам не струва нищо; вижте perf редовете какво спестява."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now."
msgstr "Сега изкл."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls per frame now (GPU per eye: 1 (K) 1.0, 2 (E) / 3 (F) 0.6, 4 (M) ~3 ms)."
msgstr "Струва %ls на кадър сега (GPU на око: 1 (K) 1.0, 2 (E) / 3 (F) 0.6, 4 (M) ~3 ms)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now: sharpening costs nothing."
msgstr "Сега изкл.: рязкостта не струва нищо."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls GPU per frame now; 0 saves it."
msgstr "Струва %ls GPU на кадър сега; 0 го спестява."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now (Sharpen strength is 0): sharpening costs nothing."
msgstr "Сега изкл. (Сила на рязкостта е 0): рязкостта не струва нищо."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Same pass as Sharpen strength: costs %ls ms GPU per frame now."
msgstr "Същият проход като Сила на рязкостта: струва %ls ms GPU на кадър сега."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "CPU %ls ms per frame now (the sampler swaps)."
msgstr "CPU %ls ms на кадър сега (сменя се семплерът)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed in flat: flat mode always uses the whole picture."
msgstr "Сиво в плосък режим: той винаги ползва цялата картина."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now: DLAA/DLSS costs nothing."
msgstr "Сега изкл.: DLAA/DLSS не струва нищо."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "DLAA costs %ls per frame at %d %%; a smaller area costs less."
msgstr "DLAA струва %ls на кадър при %d %%; по-малка област струва по-малко."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now: costs nothing."
msgstr "Сега изкл.: не струва нищо."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls per frame now; the profiles medium / low cut it."
msgstr "Струва %ls на кадър сега; профилите среден / нисък го режат."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls per frame now; fewer mirrors cost less."
msgstr "Струва %ls на кадър сега; по-малко огледала струват по-малко."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed: Smooth mirrors is off."
msgstr "Сиво: плавните огледала са изкл."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Always on: dlaa.ini mirror mode 3 is in turns already."
msgstr "Винаги вкл.: режимът на огледала 3 в dlaa.ini вече е на смени."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The mirrors cost %ls per frame now."
msgstr "Огледалата струват %ls на кадър сега."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed: only for AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D)."
msgstr "Сиво: само за AMD X3D процесори с две групи ядра (7950X3D, 9950X3D)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "On now: the game runs only on the cores with the big cache."
msgstr "Сега вкл.: играта работи само на ядрата с големия кеш."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "On, but not applied: the game's cores were already limited (see the log)."
msgstr "Вкл., но не е приложено: ядрата на играта вече бяха ограничени (виж журнала)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed in VR: VR always runs DLAA on the finished picture."
msgstr "Сиво във VR: VR винаги пуска DLAA върху готовата картина."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed: VR only."
msgstr "Сиво: само VR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Greyed: the game's console is off. Set g_developer and g_console to \"1\" in config.cfg while the "
"game is closed."
msgstr ""
"Сиво: конзолата на играта е изкл. Задайте g_developer и g_console на \"1\" в config.cfg, докато "
"играта е затворена."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Waiting: click the game window on the desktop. The mod types into the game's console only while "
"the game window has the focus."
msgstr ""
"Изчакване: щракнете върху прозореца на играта на работния плот. Модът пише в конзолата на играта "
"само докато прозорецът на играта е на фокус."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Sending to the game's console..."
msgstr "Изпращане към конзолата на играта..."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's log did not confirm the last change: see the mod's log."
msgstr "Логът на играта не потвърди последната промяна: вижте лога на мода."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Mix and split need the game's TAA: set Anti-aliasing to TAA in the game's graphics settings."
msgstr ""
"Смес и деленето изискват TAA на играта: задайте Anti-aliasing на TAA в графичните настройки на "
"играта."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's TAA is not running now: the mod runs alone."
msgstr "TAA на играта не работи сега: модът работи сам."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's TAA is running now: set the game's Anti-aliasing to Disabled, or set Mode to Mix."
msgstr ""
"TAA на играта работи сега: задайте Anti-aliasing на играта на Изключено или задайте Режим на Смес."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's TAA is running now: split is on."
msgstr "TAA на играта работи сега: деленето е включено."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's TAA is running now: the mix is on."
msgstr "TAA на играта работи сега: сместа е включена."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: its TAA pass did not run in this frame."
msgstr "Върнато към TAA на играта: преминаването на TAA в този кадър не се изпълни."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: the game's jitter could not be read (see the log)."
msgstr "Върнато към TAA на играта: джитърът на играта не можа да се прочете (вижте журнала)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: the picture before the game's TAA was not found."
msgstr "Върнато към TAA на играта: картината преди TAA на играта не беше намерена."

